          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "33",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kä cu Ner a gua̱n Kic, kä cu Kic a gua̱n Thɔɔl, kä cu Thɔɔl a gua̱n Jo-na-than kɛnɛ Mal-ki-cuwa kɛ Ä-bi-na-dab kɛnɛ Ɛc-baal",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CH.8.33",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CH.8.33"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "note",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "f",
            "caller": "#"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "8:33",
              "type": "text"
            },
            {
              "text": "Ɛc-baal",
              "type": "text"
            },
            {
              "text": "Cɔalkɛ jɛ bä Ic-bo-cɛth. Kuɛnɛ ka 2 Tha-muɛl 2:8 kä Ic-bo-cɛth kɛ thok Ɣi-bɛ-ru lotdɛ ni ɣöö raan po̱cä kä Ɛc-baal kɛ thok Ɣi-bɛ-ru lotdɛ ni ɣöö raan kuoth Baal.",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": ". ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CH.8.33",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CH.8.33"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "34",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CH 8:34"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "34",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kä cu gaat Jo-na-than a Mɛ-rib-baal min la gua̱n Mikaa. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CH.8.34",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CH.8.34"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "note",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "f",
            "caller": "#"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "8:34",
              "type": "text"
            },
            {
              "text": "Mɛ-rib-baal",
              "type": "text"
            },
            {
              "text": "Cɔalkɛ jɛ bä i̱ Mɛ-pi-bo-cɛth. Kuɛnɛ kä 2 Tha-muɛl 4:4 kä Mɛ-rib-baal kɛ thok Ɣi-bɛ-ru lotdɛ ni ɣöö raan kuɔth Baal, kä Mɛ-pi-bo-cɛth kɛ thok Ɣi-bɛ-ru lotdɛ ni ɣöö raan po̱cä.",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
