          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "40",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kä cu gaat U-lam a wutni ti buɔ̱m buɔ̱ɔ̱m ti lua̱ŋkɛ ko̱r. Cukɛ tekɛ gaat kɛ gaatdöödiɛn ti ŋuan, cu matdiɛn diaal a nɛy ti kuɔ̱r wi̱cdɛ jiɛɛn dhieec. Cu kɛn diaal a kuay Ben-ya-min.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
